<p>A Q&A thumbnail is a question, so the question is the title and the title is hand-written — Caveat, big, tilted two degrees, in quotes. A giant “?” in Geist Pixel stands behind in a wash of the accent, the golden rectangles sit faint on cream paper, and the face is small and ringed bottom right. The chip says Q&A so the viewer knows the format before the words.</p>
